    text te1 "a short but wondrous season:" #8f887c x 500 y 433 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t2 "Прозра́чный во́здух, день хруста́льный," say_voice b gloss ["clear","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 500 y 365 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te2 "clear air, a crystal day," #8f887c x 500 y 293 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t3 "И лучеза́рны вечера́…" say_voice b gloss ["","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 500 y 225 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te3 "and the evenings shine with light…" #8f887c x 500 y 153 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t4 "Где бо́дрый серп гуля́л и па́дал ко́лос," say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 read_first true stress none x 500 y 645 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te4 "Where the brisk sickle swung and the ears of grain fell," #8f887c x 500 y 573 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t5 "Тепе́рь уж пу́сто всё — просто́р везде́, —" say_voice b gloss ["","","","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 500 y 505 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te5 "now all is empty, open space everywhere;" #8f887c x 500 y 433 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t6 "Лишь паути́ны то́нкий во́лос" say_voice b gloss ["","cobweb","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 500 y 365 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te6 "only a fine thread of cobweb" #8f887c x 500 y 293 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t7 "Блести́т на пра́здной борозде́…" say_voice b gloss ["","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 500 y 225 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te7 "glints on the idle furrow…" #8f887c x 500 y 153 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t8 "Пусте́ет во́здух, птиц не слы́шно бо́ле," say_voice b gloss ["","","","","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 read_first true stress none x 500 y 645 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te8 "The air empties, no birds are heard any more," #8f887c x 500 y 573 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t9 "Но далеко́ ещё до пе́рвых зи́мних бурь —" say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","","storms"] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 500 y 505 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te9 "but the first winter storms are still far off," #8f887c x 500 y 433 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t10 "И льётся чи́стая и тёплая лазу́рь" say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","azure"] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 500 y 365 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te10 "and the clear, warm azure pours" #8f887c x 500 y 293 font_size 28 hidden true
    glossed t11 "На отдыха́ющее по́ле…" say_voice b gloss ["","",""] show_gloss after gloss_size 22 stress none x 500 y 225 width 860 font_size 38 hidden true
    text te11 "onto the resting field…" #8f887c x 500 y 153 font_size 28 hidden true
